# Anger of the Gods and Ancient Adamantoise: "All damage that would be dealt to you and other permanents you control is dealt to
# this creature instead". Anger's 3 damage aimed at Bot1's Ornithopter is dealt to the Adamantoise (CR 614.9), so the
# Ornithopter was dealt no damage by it and "exile it instead" does not cover it: Infernal Grasp then destroys it and it goes
# to the graveyard. The Adamantoise, already holding 17 from Fire Covenant, is dealt its own 3 and the Ornithopter's 3 (23 of
# 20): it would die, so it is exiled instead and its "when this creature dies" trigger never happens - no Treasures.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Ancient Adamantoise
Ornithopter
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Fire Covenant
Island
Anger of the Gods
Infernal Grasp
Island x10

